{"id": "family-health-cross-session-001", "category": "family_long_memory", "runner": "harness", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-b1bfcf1f", "family_id": "bench-health-b1bfcf1f", "setup_members": [], "answer": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "fefeac86-0ff9-421e-98de-737775b6ddc0", "latency_ms": 5018.18, "turns": [{"response": "奶奶，听到您头疼不舒服，我有点担心您呢。您先别急着忙活，找个安静的地方坐下休息一会儿，喝点温水。\n\n如果方便的话，可以轻轻揉揉太阳穴，闭上眼睛歇一歇。要是头疼得厉害、还伴有头晕恶心，或者休息后还是不好转，一定要告诉家人或者及时联系医生看看哦。\n\n您今天是不是没休息好呀？记得别太累着自己。如果有什么需要我帮忙的，随时跟我说。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-b1bfcf1f-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.990674, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:34.415394", "trace_id": "14784199-8b5d-4076-9938-ce24c6417186"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过头疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-b1bfcf1f-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001914, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:34.421127", "trace_id": "fefeac86-0ff9-421e-98de-737775b6ddc0"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": {"family_id": "bench-health-b1bfcf1f", "person_name": "奶奶", "events": [{"event_id": "4faa43fd-2794-4652-8eba-1afaa5815992", "family_id": "bench-health-b1bfcf1f", "person_name": "王奶奶", "symptom": "头疼", "source_session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-session-001-b1bfcf1f-grandma", "occurred_at": "2026-08-12T18:04:34.413004", "created_at": "2026-08-12T18:04:34.413004"}]}, "harness_trace": [{"type": "harness_start", "runner": "harness", "family_id": "bench-health-b1bfcf1f"}, {"type": "agent_http_call", "session_id": "eval-family-health-cross-sessio