{"id": "family-health-multiple-members-002", "category": "family_long_memory", "runner": "harness", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-827e6c42", "family_id": "bench-multi-827e6c42", "setup_members": [], "answer": "奶奶今天提到过咳嗽。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "426f53dc-d1b4-4a4f-b5c5-a285889a8abc", "latency_ms": 8599.22, "turns": [{"response": "您咳嗽了呀，要多喝点温水润润嗓子，注意休息别着凉。如果咳嗽得厉害或者一直不好，记得告诉家人，让他们陪您去看看医生。需要我帮您看看外面的天气适不适合出门透透气吗？", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-827e6c42-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 3.979829, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:38.407093", "trace_id": "a0b67a57-651d-4704-bf7f-37d57ceb376f"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "您头晕啊，先别着急，赶紧坐下来歇一歇，喝点温水。\n\n头晕可大可小，您先注意这几点：\n第一，先坐下或躺下休息，别走动；\n第二，如果头晕得厉害，还伴有恶心、手脚发麻或者说话不清楚，一定要马上联系家人或者打急救电话；\n第三，要是平时有高血压这些老毛病，记得量一量血压。\n\n您先好好休息一下，如果感觉还是不舒服，一定要让家里人知道。需要我帮您做点什么吗？比如看看今天天气适不适合出去透透气？", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-827e6c42-grandpa", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.603804, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:43.014818", "trace_id": "b60ad45f-0430-44fb-a13f-6d5f70045f0f"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "奶奶今天提到过咳嗽。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-multiple-members-002-827e6c42-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001686, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:43.020560", "trace_id": "426f53dc-d1b4-4a4f-b5c5-a285889a8abc"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": {"famil