{"id": "family-health-father-recall-006", "category": "family_long_memory", "runner": "harness", "session_id": "eval-family-health-father-recall-006-bc1af656", "family_id": "bench-father-health-bc1af656", "setup_members": [], "answer": "爸爸今天提到过胸口疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "tool_calls": [], "command_type": null, "trace_id": "5b346bab-435e-4523-b421-fda9b7af5a35", "latency_ms": 4226.81, "turns": [{"response": "听到您胸口疼，我很担心您。胸口疼有时可能是要紧的情况，请您先别着急走动。\n\n如果疼得很厉害，或者伴有出汗、气短、头晕这些情况，请马上让家人帮忙，或者拨打急救电话120。\n\n如果疼痛比较轻微，也请您先坐下来休息一下，尽量别劳累。我还是建议您尽快告诉家人或去医院看看，这样才放心。\n\n您身边现在有人陪着您吗？需要我帮您联系家人吗？", "session_id": "eval-family-health-father-recall-006-bc1af656-father", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": null, "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 4.213254, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:58.598715", "trace_id": "7a5687c4-7ca9-4412-bed5-67c2b749bdcb"}, "reminder": null}, {"response": "爸爸今天提到过胸口疼。这是健康情况记录，若症状持续或加重，建议尽快联系家人或医生。", "session_id": "eval-family-health-father-recall-006-bc1af656-grandma", "agent_type": "companion", "success": true, "tool_used": false, "tool_results": [], "command_type": null, "metadata": {"mode": "elder", "mode_source": "request", "processing_time": 0.001627, "message_count": 1, "timestamp": "2026-08-12T18:04:58.604250", "trace_id": "5b346bab-435e-4523-b421-fda9b7af5a35"}, "reminder": null}], "storage_check": {"family_id": "bench-father-health-bc1af656", "person_name": "爸爸", "events": [{"event_id": "6e9703a5-f61c-43b9-a9b9-ce4b014761fb", "family_id": "bench-father-health-bc1af656", "person_name": "周爸爸", "symptom": "胸口疼", "source_session_id": "eval-family-health-father-recall-006-bc1af656-father", "occurred_at": "2026-08-12T18:04:58.597377", "created_at": "2026-08-12T18:04:58.597377"}]}, "harness_trace": [{"type": "harness_start", "runner": "harness", "family_id": "bench-father-health-bc1af656"}, {"type": "agent_http_call", "session_id":